{"id":49999,"date":"2026-03-17T09:14:21","date_gmt":"2026-03-17T08:14:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=49999"},"modified":"2026-09-07T11:27:47","modified_gmt":"2026-09-07T10:27:47","slug":"corrida-do-tejo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-do-tejo\/","title":{"rendered":"45\u00aa Corrida do Tejo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">45\u00aa Corrida do Tejo 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>45\u00aa Corrida do Tejo 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>13 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, afirmando-se como uma das provas de atletismo de estrada mais m\u00edticas, participadas e emblem\u00e1ticas de Portugal. Organizada diretamente pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Oeiras<\/strong> desde 1981, a corrida celebra o desporto para todos com um ambiente costeiro deslumbrante ao longo da foz do Rio Tejo e do Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O cl\u00e1ssico tra\u00e7ado de <strong>10 km em linha reta<\/strong> decorre na <strong>Avenida Marginal (EN 6)<\/strong> totalmente cortada ao tr\u00e2nsito, com partida junto \u00e0 <strong>Esta\u00e7\u00e3o CP de Alg\u00e9s<\/strong> e meta instalada na c\u00e9nica <strong>Praia da Torre<\/strong>, em Oeiras. Com partidas organizadas por vagas e caixas de ritmo (ondas de partida), o evento assegura abastecimentos aos 5 km e na meta, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, medalha finisher comemorativa, transporte gratuito CP e seguro desportivo.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida Marginal (Esta\u00e7\u00e3o CP de Alg\u00e9s), Oeiras, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km (Avenida Marginal)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Oeiras<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida do Tejo 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">13.00 \u20ac a 18.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: PERCURSO DO EVENTO --><\/p>\n<section id=\"pr-percurso\" class=\"pr-track-section\" style=\"margin:48px 0;scroll-margin-top:80px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:32px;\"><span class=\"pr-hero-badge\" style=\"color:#C4B5FD;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.3);padding:6px 16px;border-radius:50px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:16px;\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f PERCURSO OFICIAL 2026<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"pr-section-title\" style=\"color:#F8FAFC;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,5vw,36px);font-weight:800;margin:0 0 12px 0;\">Percurso &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#C4B5FD 20%,#8B5CF6 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;\">Altimetria<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"pr-section-subtitle\" style=\"color:#94A3B8;font-size:16px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;\">Tra\u00e7ado oficial, mapa interativo e altimetria da 45\u00aa Corrida do Tejo 2026.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-track-waypoints\" style=\"margin:24px 0 32px 0;\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:130px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.22);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 12px;text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;margin-bottom:4px;\">\ud83d\udfe2<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">Partida<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#94A3B8;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;\">Alg\u00e9s (Esta\u00e7\u00e3o CP)<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:130px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.22);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 12px;text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;margin-bottom:4px;\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">Km 3,5<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#94A3B8;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;\">Avenida Marginal (Caxias)<\/div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><span style=\"background:rgba(56,189,248,0.12);color:#38BDF8;border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.28);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;display:inline-block;\">\ud83d\udca7 Abastecimento<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:130px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.22);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 12px;text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;margin-bottom:4px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">Km 5<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#94A3B8;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;\">Pa\u00e7o de Arcos<\/div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><span style=\"background:rgba(56,189,248,0.12);color:#38BDF8;border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.28);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;display:inline-block;\">Cronometragem 5K<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:130px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.22);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 12px;text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;margin-bottom:4px;\">\ud83d\udca7<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">Km 7<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#94A3B8;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;\">Santo Amaro de Oeiras<\/div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><span style=\"background:rgba(56,189,248,0.12);color:#38BDF8;border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.28);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;display:inline-block;\">\ud83d\udca7 Abastecimento<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1;min-width:130px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.22);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 12px;text-align:center;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;margin-bottom:4px;\">\ud83c\udfc1<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">Chegada<\/div>\n<div style=\"color:#94A3B8;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;\">Praia da Torre (Oeiras)<\/div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><span style=\"background:rgba(56,189,248,0.12);color:#38BDF8;border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.28);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;display:inline-block;\">Meta &#038; Abastecimento<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-track-map\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.2);\"><iframe src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/d\/u\/1\/embed?mid=1Nlu-_5ebGUnf3SvhO1qwByWiZlIeg08&#038;ehbc=2E312F\" title=\"Mapa do Percurso 45\u00aa Corrida do Tejo 2026\" width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;border:none;\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-track-altimetry\" style=\"margin:36px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<h3 style=\"color:#C4B5FD;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Perfil de Altimetria &amp; Desn\u00edvel<\/h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/altimetria-corrida-do-tejo.webp\" alt=\"Altimetria 45\u00aa Corrida do Tejo 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.25);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\" title=\"\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"color:#94A3B8;font-size:13px;margin-top:10px;font-style:italic;\">Perfil oficial de altimetria e desn\u00edvel do percurso<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: PERCURSO DO EVENTO --><\/p>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Corrida do Tejo 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 45\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 13 de setembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09h00 atrav\u00e9s de partidas faseadas por vagas de ritmo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localizam os pontos de partida e de meta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida situa-se na Avenida Marginal junto \u00e0 Esta\u00e7\u00e3o de Alg\u00e9s e a meta encontra-se na Praia da Torre, em Oeiras.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e como se caracteriza o percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova tem a dist\u00e2ncia oficial de 10.000 metros, disputada integralmente em asfalto na Avenida Marginal com vista panor\u00e2mica para o mar.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe transporte p\u00fablico gratuito para os atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, os atletas t\u00eam direito a transporte gratuito nos comboios urbanos da Linha de Cascais da CP mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do dorsal de participante.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem no site oficial da Corrida do Tejo atrav\u00e9s do link direto disponibilizado no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"45\u00aa Corrida do Tejo 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida Marginal (Esta\u00e7\u00e3o CP de Alg\u00e9s), Oeiras\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Oeiras\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"C\u00e2mara Municipal de Oeiras\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Corrida do Tejo 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 45\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 13 de setembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09h00 atrav\u00e9s de partidas faseadas por vagas de ritmo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se localizam os pontos de partida e de meta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida situa-se na Avenida Marginal junto \u00e0 Esta\u00e7\u00e3o de Alg\u00e9s e a meta encontra-se na Praia da Torre, em Oeiras.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia e como se caracteriza o percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova tem a dist\u00e2ncia oficial de 10.000 metros, disputada integralmente em asfalto na Avenida Marginal com vista panor\u00e2mica para o mar.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existe transporte p\u00fablico gratuito para os atletas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, os atletas t\u00eam direito a transporte gratuito nos comboios urbanos da Linha de Cascais da CP mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do dorsal de participante.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem no site oficial da Corrida do Tejo atrav\u00e9s do link direto disponibilizado no portal Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66157,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[28,27],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-49999","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-alges-oeiras","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corrida","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/45-corrida-do-tejo-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunnin